  "solution": {
    "text": "Rearranging the given equations, we get,<br /><math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />For no solution,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and atleast one of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> must be non zero.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo